```{=html}
<div class="cv-list">
<% for (const item of items) { %>
<div class="cv-row">
<span class="cv-row-main"><%= item.degree %></span>
<span class="cv-row-meta"><%= item.institution %><% if (item.start || item.end) { %> · <%= item.start || "" %><% if (item.end) { %>–<%= item.end %><% } %><% } %></span>
</div>
<% } %>
</div>
```
